---
title: Agent lifecycle
---
flowchart TD
  click pool href "crates/uze-core/src/project/checkout.rs"
  place([An agent is placed]) --> pool{A free recorded slot?}
  pool -->|yes| reuse[Reset it to the base<br/>on branch agent/id]
  pool -->|no| cut[git worktree add .worktrees/id<br/>and record that UZE made it]
  reuse --> setup[The project's setup command runs]
  cut --> setup
  setup --> name[uze agent work name type/subject<br/>or, still unnamed at the first commit,<br/>named from that commit's subject]
  name --> running[Running]
  running --> evaluate{What Git says, each pass}
  evaluate -->|a dirty tree| uncommitted[Uncommitted]
  evaluate -->|agent gone, work left| parked[Parked]
  evaluate -->|agent gone, nothing to deliver| closed[Closed]
  closed --> free[Its slot is free:<br/>kept as a spare, or given back]
  uncommitted -->|it commits| ready
  evaluate -->|commits ahead, clean tree| ready[Ready]
  ready -->|the pane went quiet| refresh[refresh<br/>rebase onto the local target]
  ready --> deliver([The operator delivers one task])
  deliver --> integrating[Integrating<br/>under the repository write lock]
  integrating --> already{Already in the target's tip?}
  already -->|squashed on the forge| integrated[Integrated]
  already -->|no| rebase{Rebase onto the tip}
  rebase -->|conflict, target untouched| conflicted[Conflicted<br/>the rebase stays paused in the checkout]
  rebase -->|clean| gate{The declared gate, on the rebased commits}
  gate -->|fails| failed[GateFailed]
  conflicted --> back[Back to the agent that owns it:<br/>only it holds the intent]
  failed --> back
  gate -->|passes| completion{The project's completion behaviour}
  completion -->|handoff| human[Ready<br/>a human integrates the branch]
  completion -->|pr| published[Ready<br/>branch pushed, request open]
  completion -->|merge| overlap{Files the target moved too?}
  overlap -->|yes| human
  overlap -->|no| forward[Fast-forward the target]
  forward --> integrated
